{"c":[{"name":"20261004T004204Z-5758654235cf32d7","text":"A closing window (Chrome tearing down its page, a Send that closes it) can reach the model without its fields before its close; routines place late edits and presses from where elements were last seen, or Caret's verified runs score as misses (B20).","type":"note"},{"name":"20261004T004204Z-584e781bcb96f4a6","text":"The agent host sets ELECTRON_RUN_AS_NODE for its children; an eval that starts Electron must drop it or Electron runs as plain Node and cannot require('electron') (B20).","type":"note"}]}
